 * Starting in version 3.16.0, this class uses {@link #secure()} for static methods and adds {@link #insecure()}.
 * </p>
 * <p>
 * Starting in version 3.15.0, this class uses {@link SecureRandom#getInstanceStrong()} for static methods.
 * </p>
 * <p>
